freeimage-maintained (3.19.27-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve HEIF primary images when optional thumbnails fail to decode.
  * Update bundled libheif to 1.23.6 and recognize HIF filenames.
  * Fix portable JPEG XR builds and add JP2/JXR diagnostic tests.
  * Improve MSVC PDB installation and bundled codec build configuration.
  * Refresh supported formats and bundled library documentation.
  * Prepare tagged Linux package builds for FreeImage 3.19.27.

