freeimage-maintained (3.19.26-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix TIFF JPEG decoding when stream and TIFF sampling factors differ; add regression coverage.
  * Reject oversized ICO dimensions before decoding.
  * Add selectable MSVC dynamic/static runtime configuration.
  * Prepare tagged Linux package builds for FreeImage 3.19.26.

